### 1. 최소 요청 — RUN_START 한 건
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "userId": -6601403713907716966,
    "eventType": "RUN_START",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-05T13:24:05.123Z",
    "difficulty": "Limited",
    "runId": -8553994346255530530,
    "floor": 1,
    "round": 1,
    "payload": { "characterClass": "WARRIOR" }
  }
]


### 2. runId/floor/round 없는 이벤트 (nullable 컬럼 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "userId": -6601403713907716966,
    "eventType": "ACCOUNT_LOGIN",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-05T13:20:00.000Z",
    "difficulty": "Standard",
    "payload": {
      "platform": "PC",
      "clientVersion": "1.2.3",
      "region": "KR"
    }
  }
]


### 3. 배열로 여러 건 (클라가 실제로 보내는 배치 형태)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "userId": -6601403713907716966,
